    "detailed_description": "A game about a house spirit - Houseboy. With the name Nafanya. The player will have to get out of a multi-unit Soviet house, which is run by the Domovoi. To find the way out, you will have to solve riddles from the spirit, and maybe even make friends with him. Soviet atmosphere and immersion in the world of Domovy - their habits and whims.<br />\r\nAs you progress, you will need to find keys and open locked rooms. Perform various tasks and solve puzzles. A first-person game with elements of horror. Explore the house, apartments and mysteries. Find clues and assemble the whole story into a single picture. The darkness can conceal various mysteries.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nF - flashlight, Tab - inventory<br />\r\nIn-game controls WASD - move, left mouse button - pick up an item. Right mouse button - inspect the item.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- pleasant graphics;<br />\r\n- simple control;<br />\r\n- interesting gameplay",
